OL,3,GNEWSAThousands spent clearing
OL,4,Afly-tipping as costs rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #175,000 has been spent
OL,7,Fclearing fly-tipping and public waste
OL,8,Fin Rotherham since 2024, according to
OL,9,Fcouncil figures.
OL,11,FA Freedom of Information (FOI) request
OL,12,Fhas shown Rotherham Council spent
OL,13,F#175,548 between 2024 and 2026.
OL,15,FThere was a rise of almost #20,000
OL,16,Fbetween 2024/25 and 2025/26 with the
OL,17,Fannual figure jumping from #78,973 to
OL,18,F#96,575.
OL,20,FRotherham Council has been contacted
OL,21,Ffor comment.
